    "A cycle charges to 100%, discharges on power to the floor, charges to 100% again, holds, then discharges to the daily limit. A due cycle starts when the Mac is awake and plugged in. Settings apply to the next cycle.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一轮循环：充到 100%，插着电放电到下限，再充到 100%，保持一段时间，最后放电到日常上限。到期的循环会在 Mac 醒着且接通电源时开始。修改的设置从下一轮起生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A cycle needs the privileged helper to discharge on power.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "插着电放电需要先安装特权辅助进程。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adapter": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
