    "The Mac stays awake while discharging. Closing the lid pauses the cycle.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "放电期间 Mac 会保持唤醒。合盖会暂停循环。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The helper must be installed and allowed before a cycle can discharge.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "必须先安装并允许辅助进程，循环才能放电。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The helper runs as root and only switches the power adapter off and on for calibration cycles. It restores the adapter on its own when BatteryKeeper quits, the Mac sleeps or the charge falls to 10%.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "辅助进程以 root 身份运行，只在校准循环中切断和恢复电源适配器。BatteryKeeper 退出、Mac 睡眠或电量降到 10% 时，它会自动恢复适配器供电。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The installed helper is outdated. Reinstall it from Settings.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已安装的辅助进程版本过旧，请在设置中重新安装。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Mac does not offer the system charge limit (macOS 26.4 or later on Apple silicon).": {
